  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC - humanitarian appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC delivers vital humanitarian assistance to people affected by armed conflict, promotes the protection of civilians and urges compliance with IHL. Its multidisciplinary response addresses emergency and longer-term needs, providing relief, supporting livelihoods, and improving access to water, medical care and other essential services. It visits people deprived of their freedom and restores family links. It supported missing people&#x2019;s families and efforts to clarify the fate of missing persons. The ICRC works closely with the Ukrainian Red Cross Society and helps build its capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
